  "behavior_before": "ManualOrder could be selected, but Queue rows could not be moved by drag/drop or arrow controls and the queue priority manifest route did not accept position fields.",
  "behavior_after": "ManualOrder exposes Save Order, top/up/down/bottom controls, row drag/drop, and Alt+Up/Alt+Down movement. The UI posts position fields through /api/queue/priority, the backend preserves priority metadata while storing manual positions, and ManualOrder sorts high-priority buckets as well as normal/low buckets.",
